{'symbol': 'AMZN', 'date': '2022-06-17 11:00:00', 'title': 'AMZN INVESTORS HAVE OPPORTUNITY TO LEAD AMAZON.COM, INC. SECURITIES FRAUD LAWSUIT', 'text': 'SHAREHOLDERS WITH $100,000 LOSSES OR MORE ARE ENCOURAGED TO CONTACT THE FIRM. LOS ANGELES , JUNE 17, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- GLANCY PRONGAY & MURRAY LLP ("GPM") ANNOUNCES THAT INVESTORS WITH SUBSTANTIAL LOSSES HAVE OPPORTUNITY TO LEAD THE SECURITIES FRAUD CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AGAINST AMAZON.COM, INC. ("AMAZON" OR THE "COMPANY") (NASDAQ: AMZN).'}{'symbol': 'AMZN', 'date': '2022-06-17 05:45:00', 'title': 'AMZN SHAREHOLDER ALERT: JAKUBOWITZ LAW REMINDS AMAZON SHAREHOLDERS OF A LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE OF JULY 5, 2022', 'text': 'NEW YORK , JUNE 17, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- JAKUBOWITZ LAW ANNOUNCES THAT A SECURITIES FRAUD CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT HAS COMMENCED ON BEHALF OF SHAREHOLDERS OF AMAZON.COM, INC. (NASDAQ: AMZN). TO RECEIVE UPDATES ON THE LAWSUIT, FILL OUT THE FORM: HTTPS://CLAIMYOURLOSS.COM/SECURITIES/AMAZON-COM-INC-LOSS-SUBMISSION-FORM/?ID=28681&FROM=4 THE LAWSUIT SEEKS TO RECOVER LOSSES FOR SHAREHOLDERS WHO PURCHASED AMAZON BETWEEN FEBRUARY 1, 2019 AND\xa0APRIL 5, 2022.'}